IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P3-section-3`
IMPORT `P3-art-25`

-- Tests of Article 25. Expected values are written from the text before the run.
-- Version dates: the text as enacted ends on 26 July 2026, the text as amended begins on 27 July 2026; Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply only from 2 December 2027, so the as-enacted functions are tested directly.

§ `Fixtures`

`P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 12 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 12 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027 and changed` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE

`P3 system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 plain circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 Section B circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS TRUE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 equivalent protection circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS TRUE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS TRUE


-- Art 25(1), positional: party type; (a) name or trademark; (b) change after placing; foreseen in the initial assessment; compliance affected; purpose modified; remains high-risk; (c) modifies the intended purpose; becomes high-risk.
`P3 party none of the circumstances` MEANS `Art 25(1) what the party has done` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 party names (a)` MEANS `Art 25(1) what the party has done` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 party substantial modification (b) by compliance` MEANS `Art 25(1) what the party has done` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 party substantial modification (b) by purpose` MEANS `Art 25(1) what the party has done` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 party change foreseen` MEANS `Art 25(1) what the party has done` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 party change affects nothing` MEANS `Art 25(1) what the party has done` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 party change leaves high-risk` MEANS `Art 25(1) what the party has done` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 party not after placing` MEANS `Art 25(1) what the party has done` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 party purpose to high-risk (c)` MEANS `Art 25(1) what the party has done` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 party purpose not high-risk (c)` MEANS `Art 25(1) what the party has done` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE
`P3 party not a third party` MEANS `Art 25(1) what the party has done` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

-- Art 25(2), positional: closely cooperated; made available the necessary information; provided the technical access and other assistance.
`P3 done all` MEANS `Art 25(2) what the initial provider has done` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 done no cooperation` MEANS `Art 25(2) what the initial provider has done` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 done no information` MEANS `Art 25(2) what the initial provider has done` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE
`P3 done no access` MEANS `Art 25(2) what the initial provider has done` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE
-- Art 25(2) third subparagraph, positional: (a) relevant, (a) done, (b) relevant, (b) done, (c) relevant, (c) done.
`P3 particulars all relevant and done` MEANS `Art 25(2) the particular obligations of the third subparagraph` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 particulars none relevant` MEANS `Art 25(2) the particular obligations of the third subparagraph` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 particulars (a) relevant not done` MEANS `Art 25(2) the particular obligations of the third subparagraph` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 particulars (b) relevant not done` MEANS `Art 25(2) the particular obligations of the third subparagraph` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 particulars (c) relevant not done` MEANS `Art 25(2) the particular obligations of the third subparagraph` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE
`P3 particulars (a) done though not relevant` MEANS `Art 25(2) the particular obligations of the third subparagraph` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

-- Art 25(3), positional: a safety component of a product under Section A legislation; the party is the product manufacturer; (a) placed together with the product under its name; (b) put into service under its name after the product was placed.
`P3 manufacturer (a)` MEANS `Art 25(3) what is the case` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE
`P3 manufacturer (b)` MEANS `Art 25(3) what is the case` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE
`P3 manufacturer neither` MEANS `Art 25(3) what is the case` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 manufacturer not a safety component` MEANS `Art 25(3) what is the case` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 not the manufacturer` MEANS `Art 25(3) what is the case` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE

-- Art 25(4), positional: what is supplied; the item is a general-purpose AI model; used or integrated in a high-risk AI system; made accessible to the public under a free and open-source licence; a written agreement; it specifies the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance.
`P3 supply tool agreed` MEANS `Art 25(4) the supply and the agreement` OF `Supplied tool`, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 supply tool no agreement` MEANS `Art 25(4) the supply and the agreement` OF `Supplied tool`, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 supply tool agreement incomplete` MEANS `Art 25(4) the supply and the agreement` OF `Supplied tool`, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE
`P3 supply AI system agreed` MEANS `Art 25(4) the supply and the agreement` OF `Supplied AI system`, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 supply AI model agreed` MEANS `Art 25(4) the supply and the agreement` OF `Supplied AI model`, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE
`P3 supply AI model no agreement` MEANS `Art 25(4) the supply and the agreement` OF `Supplied AI model`, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 supply other item` MEANS `Art 25(4) the supply and the agreement` OF `Supplied something else`, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 supply open source component` MEANS `Art 25(4) the supply and the agreement` OF `Supplied component`, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 supply open source GPAI component` MEANS `Art 25(4) the supply and the agreement` OF `Supplied component`, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 supply open source AI model` MEANS `Art 25(4) the supply and the agreement` OF `Supplied AI model`, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`P3 supply tool not integrated` MEANS `Art 25(4) the supply and the agreement` OF `Supplied tool`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE


§ `Art 25(1): the three circumstances, one by one`

#ASSERT `Art 25(1)(a) the party puts its name or trademark on a high-risk AI system already placed on the market or put into service` `P3 party names (a)`
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(1)(a) the party puts its name or trademark on a high-risk AI system already placed on the market or put into service` `P3 party none of the circumstances`)
#ASSERT `Art 25(1)(b) the party makes a substantial modification that leaves the system a high-risk AI system` `P3 party substantial modification (b) by compliance`
#ASSERT `Art 25(1)(b) the party makes a substantial modification that leaves the system a high-risk AI system` `P3 party substantial modification (b) by purpose`
-- Art 3(23): a change foreseen or planned in the initial conformity assessment is no substantial modification; nor is one that affects neither compliance nor the intended purpose; nor one made before the placing; nor one after which the system is no longer high-risk.
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(1)(b) the party makes a substantial modification that leaves the system a high-risk AI system` `P3 party change foreseen`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(1)(b) the party makes a substantial modification that leaves the system a high-risk AI system` `P3 party change affects nothing`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(1)(b) the party makes a substantial modification that leaves the system a high-risk AI system` `P3 party not after placing`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(1)(b) the party makes a substantial modification that leaves the system a high-risk AI system` `P3 party change leaves high-risk`)
#ASSERT `Art 25(1)(c) the party modifies the intended purpose so that the AI system becomes a high-risk AI system` `P3 party purpose to high-risk (c)`
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(1)(c) the party modifies the intended purpose so that the AI system becomes a high-risk AI system` `P3 party purpose not high-risk (c)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(1)(c) the party modifies the intended purpose so that the AI system becomes a high-risk AI system` `P3 party none of the circumstances`)

§ `Art 25(1): the party is considered to be the provider`

#ASSERT `Art 25(1) the party is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 party names (a)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 25(1) the party is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 party substantial modification (b) by compliance` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 25(1) the party is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 party substantial modification (b) by purpose` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 25(1) the party is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 party purpose to high-risk (c)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- None of the circumstances holds: the list is not closed with "only" (NOTHING-kind, list not closed; fork F-25-1-closed).
#ASSERT `Art 25(1) the party is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 party none of the circumstances` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 25(1) the party is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 party change foreseen` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 25(1) the party is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 party purpose not high-risk (c)` EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not a distributor, importer, deployer or other third-party: the paragraph does not speak.
#ASSERT `Art 25(1) the party is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 party not a third party` EQUALS NOTHING
-- Before the group applies; Art 2(13) may limit it; Art 2(2) cuts it off.
#ASSERT `Art 25(1) the party is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 party names (a)` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 25(1) the party is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` `P3 party names (a)` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 25(1) the party is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` `P3 party names (a)` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 25(1) the party is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 party names (a)` EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Art 25(2): the initial provider is no longer a provider`

-- args: the circumstances of paragraph 1 occur; the initial provider has clearly specified that its AI system is not to be changed into a high-risk AI system
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) the initial provider is no longer considered to be a provider of that specific AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) the initial provider is no longer considered to be a provider of that specific AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) the initial provider is no longer considered to be a provider of that specific AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) the initial provider is no longer considered to be a provider of that specific AI system` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) the initial provider is no longer considered to be a provider of that specific AI system` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 25(2): the duty to cooperate, each text in its own function and the dispatcher on the date asked`

-- As enacted: all three limbs are needed.
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) as enacted the initial provider has cooperated` `P3 done all`
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(2) as enacted the initial provider has cooperated` `P3 done no cooperation`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(2) as enacted the initial provider has cooperated` `P3 done no information`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(2) as enacted the initial provider has cooperated` `P3 done no access`)
-- As amended: the same three limbs, and each of points (a) to (c) where relevant.
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) as amended the initial provider has cooperated` `P3 done all` `P3 particulars all relevant and done`
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) as amended the initial provider has cooperated` `P3 done all` `P3 particulars none relevant`
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(2) as amended the initial provider has cooperated` `P3 done no cooperation` `P3 particulars none relevant`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(2) as amended the initial provider has cooperated` `P3 done no information` `P3 particulars none relevant`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(2) as amended the initial provider has cooperated` `P3 done no access` `P3 particulars none relevant`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(2) as amended the initial provider has cooperated` `P3 done all` `P3 particulars (a) relevant not done`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(2) as amended the initial provider has cooperated` `P3 done all` `P3 particulars (b) relevant not done`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(2) as amended the initial provider has cooperated` `P3 done all` `P3 particulars (c) relevant not done`)
-- A point done though it was not relevant is no failure.
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) as amended the initial provider has cooperated` `P3 done all` `P3 particulars (a) done though not relevant`
-- The two versions part ways exactly where the third subparagraph adds an obligation: the text as enacted has no points (a) to (c), so a relevant point left undone breaks only the amended text.
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) as enacted the initial provider has cooperated` `P3 done all`
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(2) as amended the initial provider has cooperated` `P3 done all` `P3 particulars (a) relevant not done`)
-- The dispatcher: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply from 2 December 2027, when the text as amended is in force.
-- args: the circumstances of paragraph 1 occur; the initial provider has clearly specified that its AI system is not to be changed into a high-risk AI system; what the initial provider has done; the particular obligations
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) the initial provider has cooperated with the new providers` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE `P3 done all` `P3 particulars all relevant and done` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) the initial provider has cooperated with the new providers` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE `P3 done all` `P3 particulars (a) relevant not done` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) the initial provider has cooperated with the new providers` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE `P3 done no cooperation` `P3 particulars none relevant` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The circumstances do not occur, or the exception applies: the duty is not triggered.
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) the initial provider has cooperated with the new providers` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE `P3 done no cooperation` `P3 particulars (a) relevant not done` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) the initial provider has cooperated with the new providers` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE `P3 done no cooperation` `P3 particulars (a) relevant not done` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) the initial provider has cooperated with the new providers` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE `P3 done all` `P3 particulars all relevant and done` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 25(2) the initial provider has cooperated with the new providers` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` TRUE FALSE `P3 done all` `P3 particulars all relevant and done` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Art 25(3): the product manufacturer is considered to be the provider`

#ASSERT `Art 25(3) the product manufacturer is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 manufacturer (a)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 25(3) the product manufacturer is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 manufacturer (b)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 25(3) the product manufacturer is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 manufacturer neither` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 25(3) the product manufacturer is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 manufacturer not a safety component` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 25(3) the product manufacturer is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 not the manufacturer` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 25(3) the product manufacturer is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 manufacturer (a)` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 25(3) the product manufacturer is considered to be the provider of the high-risk AI system` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` `P3 manufacturer (a)` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Art 25(4): the items the paragraph names, version by version, and the carve-out`

-- The text as enacted names an AI system, tools, services, components and processes; the text as amended adds "AI model".
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) as enacted the item is one the paragraph names` `P3 supply tool agreed`
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) as enacted the item is one the paragraph names` `P3 supply AI system agreed`
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(4) as enacted the item is one the paragraph names` `P3 supply AI model agreed`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(4) as enacted the item is one the paragraph names` `P3 supply other item`)
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) as amended the item is one the paragraph names` `P3 supply tool agreed`
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) as amended the item is one the paragraph names` `P3 supply AI system agreed`
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) as amended the item is one the paragraph names` `P3 supply AI model agreed`
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(4) as amended the item is one the paragraph names` `P3 supply other item`)
-- Each side of 27 July 2026: an AI model is outside the paragraph on 26 July 2026 and inside it on 27 July 2026.
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(4) the item is one the paragraph names on the date asked` (Date 26 7 2026) `P3 supply AI model agreed`)
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the item is one the paragraph names on the date asked` (Date 27 7 2026) `P3 supply AI model agreed`
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the item is one the paragraph names on the date asked` (Date 26 7 2026) `P3 supply tool agreed`
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the item is one the paragraph names on the date asked` (Date 27 7 2026) `P3 supply tool agreed`
-- The carve-out is the same wording on both sides: a free and open-source tool, service, process or component made accessible to the public, other than a general-purpose AI model.
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the paragraph does not apply because of the free and open-source carve-out` `P3 supply open source component`
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(4) the paragraph does not apply because of the free and open-source carve-out` `P3 supply open source GPAI component`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(4) the paragraph does not apply because of the free and open-source carve-out` `P3 supply open source AI model`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 25(4) the paragraph does not apply because of the free and open-source carve-out` `P3 supply tool agreed`)

§ `Art 25(4): the written agreement`

#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the provider and the third party have specified by written agreement the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 supply tool agreed` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the provider and the third party have specified by written agreement the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 supply AI system agreed` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the provider and the third party have specified by written agreement the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 supply AI model agreed` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the provider and the third party have specified by written agreement the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 supply tool no agreement` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the provider and the third party have specified by written agreement the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 supply tool agreement incomplete` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the provider and the third party have specified by written agreement the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 supply AI model no agreement` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- An item the paragraph does not name, an item not used or integrated in a high-risk AI system, and the free and open-source carve-out: not covered.
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the provider and the third party have specified by written agreement the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 supply other item` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the provider and the third party have specified by written agreement the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 supply tool not integrated` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the provider and the third party have specified by written agreement the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 supply open source component` EQUALS NOTHING
-- A general-purpose AI model is not carved out, even when free and open source.
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the provider and the third party have specified by written agreement the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 supply open source GPAI component` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the provider and the third party have specified by written agreement the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 supply open source AI model` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the provider and the third party have specified by written agreement the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 supply tool agreed` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the provider and the third party have specified by written agreement the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` `P3 supply tool agreed` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the provider and the third party have specified by written agreement the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` `P3 supply tool agreed` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Art 25(4) second subparagraph and Art 25(5)`

-- args: the AI Office has developed voluntary model terms; it took contractual requirements into account; the terms are published; free of charge; in an easily usable electronic format
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the AI Office has met the requirements for the voluntary model terms` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the AI Office has met the requirements for the voluntary model terms` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the AI Office has met the requirements for the voluntary model terms` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 25(4) the AI Office has met the requirements for the voluntary model terms` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
